identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.24019455"
abstract: >-
  A provenance-tracked, site-level dataset of 108 CDM-anchored landfill sites in
  16 Asian countries. It combines measured landfill-gas recovery at 22 sites,
  engineering and waste-history attributes for 86 additional sites, 534 annual
  waste-inflow records, waste-composition records for 42 sites, and 1,728
  site-years of NASA POWER climate covariates. It is not a national emissions
  inventory and must not be used for country-level methane totals.
